; ----------------------------------------------------------------------
; Roland JV-2080 Cakewalk 8 Instrument File.  Revision April 1999
;   1999 Yury Schwartz (yschwartz@bigfoot.com)
; includes 16 SR-JV Series Expansion Boards with patch names, drum kits 
; (except for the notes for Asia drums - if you have it, e-mail me, please)
; and Menu Patch
; Files used for creation of this file:
; (1)Roland JV-2080 64-Voice Synthesizer Cakewalk 6 Pro Instrument File
;      1997-98 Li'l Chips Systems
;    (http://www.lilchips.com)(info@lilchips.com)
; (2)Roland JV-1080, JV-2080, XP-50, XP-80
;      98 as of April 1998 Benjamin R. Tubb
;    (http://home.cybertron.com/~brtubb/jvxp.html)(brtubb@cybertron.com)
; (3) Special thanks to Jonathan Klizas for Asia drums list
; This example has the following 8 expansion boards installed at:
; SR-JV80-09 Session at Slot-A
; SR-JV80-02 Orchestral at Slot-B
; SR-JV80-10 Bass&Drums at Slot-C
; SR-JV80-05 World at Slot-D
; SR-JV80-06 Dance at Slot-E
; SR-JV80-07 Super Sound Set at Slot-F
; SR-JV80-11 Techno at Slot-G
; SR-JV80-14 Asia at Slot-H
---------------------------------------------------
